CREATE INDEX idx_orders_status_created_at ON orders (status, created_at DESC);

This composite index covers both the WHERE clause and the ORDER BY, eliminating the sequential scan and the sort. Given that only ~15% of rows have status 'PENDING', this index will reduce the query time drastically, likely from 153 ms to under 1 ms.

